>> Animal := Zavatra vaovao.
Animal rehefa: ['sound:'] ataovy: { :s azy sound := s. }.
Animal rehefa: ['makeSound'] ataovy: { Vokatra soraty: azy sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal vaovao.
Cat rehefa: ['init'] ataovy: { azy sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat rehefa: ['meow'] ataovy: { tena makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
